    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_text">This app uses the AccessibilityService API to convert gamepad inputs into mouse movements, clicks, drags, and scrolling actions.\n\n• Purpose: Simulates screen touches and gestures based on gamepad input to provide core app functionality.\n\n• Data Collection: No personal or sensitive data is collected, stored, or shared through the Accessibility API.\n\nThis permission is essential for the app to function. Do you agree?</string>
