    <string name="control_guide_desc">• Xbox button / L3(Left Stick Click): Turn Mouse Cursor ON/OFF\n• L-Stick: Move Cursor\n• R-Stick: Scroll Screen\n• A button: Left Click / Drag\n• B button: Back\n• Select: Recent Apps\n• Start: Home Screen\n• LB / RB: Previous / Next Media\n• LT / RT: Resize Window\n• Y button: Play / Pause\n\n※ When the mouse is OFF, the gamepad operates in the default Android focus mode.</string>
